** Chapter Information Specification **
Header (Fixed length, 8): 
[0x0] Bit Mask:
0x0001 - Depends on 0x0002
0x0002 - Type:
if 0x0001 is 0 and 0x0002 is 0 - Default
if 0x0001 is 0 and 0x0002 is 1 - Continue Chapter
if 0x0001 is 1 and 0x0002 is 0 - Non-Spell Chapter
if 0x0001 is 1 and 0x0002 is 1 - Spell Chapter
0x0004 - Appears on easy difficulty
0x0008 - Appears on normal difficulty
0x0010 - Appears on hard difficulty
0x0020 - Appears on max difficulty
0x0040 - Appears on extra difficulty
[ONLY IF SPELL]
0x0100 - Timeout card
0x0200 - Boss Invincible
[0x1] - ID
[0x2] - Length
[0x3] - Spell Card Number
[0x4] - Spell Card Background